{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736448287510495254","content":"He starts with his left ring finger. Next to the healed scar of Rah. A long deep gouge. \"Calmation.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T13:23:22.980000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738748648044888156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736448287510495254","content":"He moves over to the middle. Not showing the pain channeling it into his claw. Another gouge same as before. \"Amara.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T13:24:32.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738748937678356492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736448287510495254","content":"His index now. Blood is starting to appear on his paw. He cuts again. \"Ebuc\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T13:25:39.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738749221305450568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
